---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const listing='https://builtbybit.com/resources/flamemc-extreme-async-performance.133143/';
---
<BaseLayout title="Download FlameMC — Folia Server with Paper Compatibility | Available Now" description="FlameMC Minecraft server software is available on BuiltByBit. Get the current release, review installation information, and test compatibility on a backup server." path="/download/">
  <main id="content" class="editorial-page download-page">
    <section class="container download-hero">
      <div class="editorial-overline"><span class="status-led"></span> AVAILABLE NOW <span class="editorial-divider">/</span> OFFICIAL LISTING</div>
      <h1>FlameMC is here.<br/><span>Build beyond one tick lane.</span></h1>
      <p class="editorial-lede">Folia's regionized multithreading with a compatibility layer for supported Bukkit and Paper plugin workflows.</p>
      <div class="download-panel"><div><span class="download-availability"><span class="pulse-dot"></span> AVAILABLE ON BUILTBYBIT</span><p>Open the product listing for current versions, purchase or download options, and release notes.</p></div><a class="button button-primary" href={listing} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get FlameMC on BuiltByBit <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      <div class="download-steps"><article><span>01 / BEFORE</span><h2>Back up your world.</h2><p>Keep a rollback copy of the existing server and plugin configurations.</p></article><article><span>02 / INSTALL</span><h2>Check the release notes.</h2><p>Follow the current listing instructions for supported Minecraft and Java versions.</p></article><article><span>03 / VALIDATE</span><h2>Test your plugins.</h2><p>Verify scheduler, teleport, inventory and world-management behavior before production use.</p></article></div>
      <div class="download-note">Compatibility is operation- and plugin-dependent. Region threading does not guarantee a fixed TPS multiplier. See the <a href="/guides/folia-plugin-compatibility/">migration checklist</a>.</div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
